<DESCRIPTION>PROXY STATEMENT FOR THE ANNUAL SHAREHOLDER MEETING
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD>
     <TITLE></TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>COLOR STAR TECHNOLOGY CO., LTD.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">80 Broad Street, 5th Floor</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">New York, NY 10005</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>NOTICE OF ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">To be held on June 30, 2025<BR>
(or any adjournment or postponement thereof)</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">June 3, 2025</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">To the Shareholders of<BR>
Color Star Technology Co., Ltd.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Notice is hereby given that the Annual General
Meeting of the Shareholders of Color Star Technology Co., Ltd., a Cayman Islands exempted company (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;) will
be held on June 29, 2025 at 10:00 p.m. Eastern Standard Time (i.e., June 30, 2025 at 10:00 a.m., Beijing time) at BlueHub, 5A, 5th Floor,
Building B, Suzhou Center Office Tower, No. 88 Suxiu Road, Suzhou Industrial Park, Suzhou, Jiangsu, PRC, 215021, and at any adjourned
or postponement thereof.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Annual General Meeting
is called for the following purposes:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; width: 0.25in">1</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">To approve as an ordinary resolution, to authorize the Company&rsquo;s board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board</B>&rdquo;) to effect a reverse share split (the &ldquo;<B>Reverse Share Split</B>&rdquo; and share consolidation (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation</B>&rdquo;) (the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation, the <B>&ldquo;Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation</B>&rdquo;), of the Company&rsquo;s authorized and issued share capital, at a ratio of up to one-for-one hundred, but in any case at a ratio of not less than one-for-five (the &ldquo;<B>Approved Consolidation Ratio</B>&rdquo;), at a date to be determined by the Board, with the exact ratios to be set at a whole number within this range, as determined by the Board in its sole discretion, such that the number of authorized and issued Class A Ordinary Shares and Class B Ordinary Shares is decreased by the Approved Consolidation Ratio, with the par value per Class A Ordinary Share and Class B Ordinary Share increased by the Approved Consolidation Ratio. Such Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation to be effected, at the specific Approved Consolidation Ratio (subject to the above maximum), as to be determined by the Board, and in order to effect the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation and subject to adjustment pending the Board&rsquo;s determination of the precise Approved Consolidation Ratio of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation, the authorized share capital of the Company shall be altered <B>from</B> US$32,000,000 divided into (i) 280,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each, and (ii) 40,000,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each, <B>to </B>US$32,000,000 divided into (i) as low as 2,800,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$0.01 each and 400,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$0.01 each (the &ldquo;<B>Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation Proposal</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">2</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To approve a special resolution, that the Company&rsquo;s name be changed from &ldquo;Color Star Technology Co., Ltd.&rdquo; to &ldquo;Zeta Network Group&rdquo; (the &ldquo;<B>Name Change Proposal</B>&rdquo;); </TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">3</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Subject to the approval and implementation of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation, and the approval of the change of the Company&rsquo;s name (the &ldquo;<B>Name Change</B>&rdquo;), as a special resolution, that the Seventh Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company, a copy of which is attached to the accompanying proxy statement as Appendix A, subject to adjustment solely in respect of the final Approved Consolidation Ratio (the &ldquo;<B>Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;), be adopted in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the existing Sixth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Articles Amendment Proposal</B>&rdquo;) to reflect the alteration of the share capital as a result of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation and the Name Change; adoption of the Articles Amendment Proposal to be approved as a special resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">4</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to approve and adopt the Company&rsquo;s 2025 Equity Incentive Plan and all transactions contemplated thereunder, including the reservation and issuance of shares (the &ldquo;<B>2025 Equity Incentive Plan Proposal</B>&rdquo;); adoption of the 2025 Equity Incentive Plan Proposal to be approved as a special resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">5</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to elect and/or re-elect, as applicable, Wei Zhang, to serve on the Board until this nominee&rsquo;s death, resignation, or removal (the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposal &ndash; Wei Zhang</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Election of Directors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">6</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to elect and/or re-elect, as applicable, Hung-Jen Kuo, to serve on the Board until this nominee&rsquo;s death, resignation, or removal (the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposal &ndash; Hung-Jen Kuo</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Election of Directors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">7</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to elect and/or re-elect, as applicable, Honglei Jiang, to serve on the Board until this nominee&rsquo;s death, resignation, or removal (the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposal &ndash; Honglei Jiang</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Election of Directors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">8</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to elect and/or re-elect, as applicable, Yan Zhang, to serve on the Board until this nominee&rsquo;s death, resignation, or removal (the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposal &ndash; Yan Zhang</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Election of Directors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">9</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and vote upon a proposal to elect and/or re-elect, as applicable, Samantha Huang, (collectively with the foregoing other nominees, the &ldquo;<B>Director Nominees</B>&rdquo;) to serve on the Board until this nominee&rsquo;s death, resignation, or removal (the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposal - Samantha Huang</B>&rdquo;, collectively with the foregoing proposals regarding election of directors, the &ldquo;<B>Election of Directors Proposals&rdquo;</B>); authorization of the Election of Directors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">10</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To ratify, confirm and approve the appointment of Assentsure PAC as the Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending June 30, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Ratification of Appointment of Auditors Proposal</B>&rdquo;); ratification of the Appointment of Auditors Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">11</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider, vote upon and approve the registered office of the Company to make all required filings with the Registrar of Companies of the Cayman Islands in relation to the above resolutions and the Company&rsquo;s Transfer Agent to make all relevant updates to the Company&rsquo;s Class A Ordinary Shares register of members and Class B Ordinary Shares register of members (the &ldquo;<B>Filing Proposal</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Filing Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution; and</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">12</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">To consider and take action upon such other matters as may properly come before the Annual General Meeting or any adjournment or postponement thereof (the &ldquo;<B>Adjournment Proposal</B>&rdquo;); authorization of the Adjournment Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution.</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">A proxy statement providing
information, and a form of proxy to vote, with respect to the foregoing matters accompany this notice. The Board of Directors of the Company
fixed the close of business on May 20, 2025 as the record date (the &ldquo;<B>Record Date</B>&rdquo;) for determining the shareholders
entitled to receive notice of and to vote at the Annual General Meeting or any adjourned or postponement thereof. The register of members
of the Company will not be closed. A list of the shareholders entitled to vote at the Annual General Meeting may be examined at the Company&rsquo;s
offices during the 10-day period preceding the Annual General Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Holders of record of the Company&rsquo;s
Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares as of the Record Date are cordially invited to attend the Annual General Meeting in
person. Your vote is important. Whether or not you expect to attend the Annual General Meeting in person, you are urged to complete, sign,
date and return the accompanying proxy form by email to wei.zhang@china-acm.com or by mail to 80 Broad Street, 5th Floor, New York NY
10005 as promptly as possible. We must receive the proxy form no later than noon on the day prior to the Annual General Meeting to ensure
your representation at such meeting. Shareholders who execute proxies retain the right to revoke them at any time prior to the voting
thereof, and may nevertheless vote in person at the Annual General Meeting. You may obtain directions to the meeting by calling our offices
at (929) 317-2699. Shareholders may obtain a copy of these materials, free of charge, by contacting the Corporate Secretary at 80 Broad
Street, 5th Floor, New York NY 10005.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>By Order of the Board of Directors,</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>Wei Zhang</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>Chairwoman of the Board</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>IMPORTANT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Whether or not you expect to attend the Annual
General Meeting in person, you are urged to complete, sign, date and return the accompanying proxy form to ensure your representation
at such meeting.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>


