    <TD COLSPAN="14" STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Shares of Stock Outstanding</B></FONT></TD>
